OL,3,GNEWSADerailed train caused #3.65m of   
OL,4,Adamage                                 
OL,6,FDamage caused when a train derailed in 
OL,7,FEssex is estimated to have cost more   
OL,8,Fthan #3.6m to repair, it has been      
OL,9,Frevealed.                              
OL,11,FThe Greater Anglia service from        
OL,12,FSouthend Victoria to London Liverpool  
OL,13,FStreet came off the tracks about 2.1   
OL,14,Fmiles (3.4km) south of Wickford station
OL,15,Fon 14 August.                          
OL,17,FSixty-two passengers were on board the 
OL,18,Ftrain - which was travelling at 77mph  
OL,19,F(124km/h) - although nobody was        
OL,20,Finjured.                               
