OL,4,Adamage                                 
OL,6,FInitial inquiries by the Rail Accident 
OL,7,FInvestigation Branch (RAIB) found the  
OL,8,Fderailment was caused by a             
OL,9,F"misalignment" or "kink" in the railway
OL,10,Ftrack.                                 
